<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hu">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Akalifornia Cafè & Pizzeria – Balatonakali</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Pacifico&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --teal:    #18BFBF;
      --teal-dk: #0D9999;
      --coral:   #E8603A;
      --sand:    #FFF7ED;
      --navy:    #0D3B5E;
      --cream:   #FEF3E2;
      --green:   #5A8C5A;
      --gold:    #F5C842;
      --white:   #FFFFFF;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background: var(--sand);
      color: var(--navy);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ── NAV ── */
    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 16px 48px;
      background: rgba(13, 59, 94, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }
    .nav-logo {
      font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive;
      color: var(--teal);
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .nav-logo span { color: var(--coral); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 32px; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--teal); }
    .nav-cta {
      background: var(--coral);
      color: var(--white) !important;
      padding: 8px 20px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-weight: 600 !important;
      transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s !important;
    }
    .nav-cta:hover { background: #d4522e !important; transform: scale(1.04); }

    /* ── HERO ── */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0D3B5E 0%, #0a5e6e 60%, #18BFBF 100%);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 120px 24px 80px;
    }

    /* Animated wave background */
    .waves-bg {
      position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 200px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .wave {
      position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: -50%; right: -50%;
      height: 120px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      opacity: 0.25;
    }
    .wave1 {
      background: var(--teal);
      animation: waveMove 6s ease-in-out infinite;
      height: 100px; bottom: -10px;
    }
    .wave2 {
      background: #1BBFBF;
      animation: waveMove 8s ease-in-out infinite reverse;
      height: 120px; bottom: -20px;
    }
    .wave3 {
      background: #3dd6d6;
      animation: waveMove 10s ease-in-out infinite;
      height: 80px; bottom: 0;
    }
    @keyframes waveMove {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0) scaleY(1); }
      50%       { transform: translateX(5%) scaleY(1.05); }
    }

    /* Floating sun */
    .sun {
      position: absolute; top: 90px; right: 12%;
      width: 110px; height: 110px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, #FDED71 30%, #F5C842 65%, transparent 100%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: sunPulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    @keyframes sunPulse {
      0%,100% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 40px 10px rgba(245,200,66,0.3); }
      50%      { transform: scale(1.07); box-shadow: 0 0 70px 20px rgba(245,200,66,0.5); }
    }

    /* Sailboat */
    .sailboat {
      position: absolute; bottom: 160px; right: 18%;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      animation: sail 12s ease-in-out infinite;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
    @keyframes sail {
      0%,100% { transform: translateX(0) rotate(-2deg); }
      50%      { transform: translateX(-30px) rotate(2deg); }
    }

    .hero-eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--teal);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--white);
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .hero-title .accent { color: var(--coral); }
    .hero-subtitle {
      font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive;
      font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.6rem);
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }
    .hero-desc {
      max-width: 520px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .hero-btns { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--coral);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 14px 34px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(232,96,58,0.4);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(232,96,58,0.55); }
    .btn-ghost {
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 14px 34px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); border-color: var(--teal); }

    /* Scroll indicator */
    .scroll-hint {
      position: absolute; bottom: 30px; left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
      font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .scroll-hint::after {
      content: '';
      width: 1px; height: 40px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.5), transparent);
      animation: scrollDown 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes scrollDown { 0%,100% { opacity: 0; } 50% { opacity: 1; } }

    /* ── STRIP ── */
    .strip {
      background: var(--coral);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      gap: 48px; flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding: 18px 40px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .strip-item {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .strip-item .icon { font-size: 1.1rem; }

    /* ── SECTION COMMON ── */
    section { padding: 96px 24px; }
    .section-center { text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 56px; }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--coral); font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--navy);
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    h2 em { color: var(--teal); font-style: normal; }
    .lead { font-size: 1.05rem; color: #4a6a7a; line-height: 1.75; }

    /* ── ABOUT ── */
    .about-section { background: var(--white); }
    .about-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 64px; align-items: center;
      max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .about-text h2 { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .about-text p { font-size: 1.02rem; color: #4a5e6e; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .about-badges { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 28px; }
    .badge {
      background: var(--cream);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(24,191,191,0.3);
      color: var(--navy);
      padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .about-visual {
      position: relative;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    }
    .logo-circle {
      width: 320px; height: 320px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal) 0%, #0a7f8f 100%);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(24,191,191,0.3);
      font-size: 9rem;
      animation: floatLogo 5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes floatLogo {
      0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50%      { transform: translateY(-12px); }
    }
    .logo-badge-tl, .logo-badge-br {
      position: absolute;
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(13,59,94,0.12);
      font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy);
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    }
    .logo-badge-tl { top: 20px; left: -10px; }
    .logo-badge-br { bottom: 20px; right: -10px; }
    .badge-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal); }

    /* ── MENU ── */
    .menu-section { background: var(--sand); }
    .menu-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 28px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .pizza-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(13,59,94,0.07);
      transition: transform 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
      cursor: default;
    }
    .pizza-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(13,59,94,0.14);
    }
    .pizza-card-img {
      width: 100%; height: 200px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 5rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .pizza-card-img.margherita { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffecd2, #fcb69f); }
    .pizza-card-img.diavola    { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4); }
    .pizza-card-img.quattro    { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a1c4fd, #c2e9fb); }
    .pizza-card-img.capricciosa{ background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4fc79, #96e6a1); }
    .pizza-card-img.prosciutto { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffeaa7, #fdcb6e); }
    .pizza-card-img.tartufo    { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0e0e0, #b0bec5); }
    .pizza-card-body { padding: 24px; }
    .pizza-name {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .pizza-origin {
      font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--teal); font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .pizza-desc { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #6a7f90; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .pizza-footer { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .pizza-price {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--coral);
    }
    .pizza-tag {
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--teal); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700;
      padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 50px; letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    /* ── DRINKS ── */
    .drinks-section { background: var(--navy); }
    .drinks-section h2 { color: var(--white); }
    .drinks-section h2 em { color: var(--gold); }
    .drinks-section .lead { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); }
    .drinks-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .drink-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      transition: background 0.25s, transform 0.25s;
    }
    .drink-card:hover { background: rgba(24,191,191,0.12); transform: translateY(-4px); }
    .drink-icon { font-size: 2.8rem; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .drink-name {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--white);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .drink-desc { font-size: 0.87rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); line-height: 1.6; }

    /* ── VIBE ── */
    .vibe-section { background: var(--white); }
    .vibe-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
      gap: 20px; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .vibe-card {
      border-radius: 20px;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: 28px; text-align: center;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .vibe-card::before {
      content: attr(data-emoji);
      position: absolute; font-size: 7rem;
      opacity: 0.15; bottom: -10px; right: -10px;
    }
    .vibe-card.v1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #18BFBF22, #18BFBF44); border: 2px solid #18BFBF55; }
    .vibe-card.v2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E8603A22, #E8603A44); border: 2px solid #E8603A55; }
    .vibe-card.v3 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5A8C5A22, #5A8C5A44); border: 2px solid #5A8C5A55; }
    .vibe-card.v4 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F5C84222, #F5C84244); border: 2px solid #F5C84255; }
    .vibe-card.v5 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0D3B5E22, #0D3B5E44); border: 2px solid #0D3B5E55; }
    .vibe-card.v6 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #18BFBF22, #E8603A33); border: 2px solid #E8603A55; }
    .vibe-card .vi { font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .vibe-card h3 { font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .vibe-card p { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #6a7f90; line-height: 1.5; }

    /* ── LOCATION ── */
    .location-section {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal) 0%, #0a7f8f 100%);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .location-section h2 { color: var(--white); }
    .location-section h2 em { color: var(--gold); }
    .location-section .lead { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); }
    .location-cards {
      display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto 48px;
    }
    .loc-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 24px 28px;
      text-align: left;
      flex: 1; min-width: 220px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }
    .loc-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; }
    .loc-label { font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .loc-value { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--white); }
    .map-btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--navy);
      padding: 16px 36px; border-radius: 50px;
      font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .map-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.22); }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    footer {
      background: var(--navy);
      padding: 48px 40px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px;
    }
    .footer-logo {
      font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive;
      font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--teal);
    }
    .footer-logo span { color: var(--coral); }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .footer-links a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--teal); }
    .footer-copy { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); font-size: 0.8rem; }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav { padding: 14px 20px; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .about-visual { order: -1; }
      .logo-circle { width: 240px; height: 240px; font-size: 7rem; }
      .logo-badge-tl, .logo-badge-br { display: none; }
      .drinks-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .vibe-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      footer { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
      .strip { gap: 20px; }
    }

    /* ── ENTRY ANIMATIONS ── */
    .fade-up {
      opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);
      transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
    }
    .fade-up.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo">Akali<span>fornia</span></div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#about">Rólunk</a></li>
    <li><a href="#menu">Pizzák</a></li>
    <li><a href="#drinks">Italok</a></li>
    <li><a href="#location" class="nav-cta">📍 Találj meg minket</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="sun"></div>
  <div class="sailboat">⛵</div>

  <p class="hero-eyebrow">Balatonakali · Olasz pizza · Tradíció</p>
  <h1 class="hero-title">
    A Balaton<br>mellé kell<br><span class="accent">egy jó pizza.</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="hero-subtitle">Akalifornia Cafè & Pizzeria</p>
  <p class="hero-desc">
    Kőből rakott faszenes kemencénkből kerül ki minden pizza – 100%-ban olasz alapanyagokból, tradicionális recept szerint, a Balaton kristálytiszta vize mellett.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-btns">
    <a href="#menu" class="btn-primary">🍕 Megnézem a pizzákat</a>
    <a href="#location" class="btn-ghost">📍 Hogy jutok el?</a>
  </div>

  <div class="waves-bg">
    <div class="wave wave1"></div>
    <div class="wave wave2"></div>
    <div class="wave wave3"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="scroll-hint">scroll</div>
</section>

<!-- STRIP -->
<div class="strip">
  <div class="strip-item"><span class="icon">🔥</span> Faszenes kemence</div>
  <div class="strip-item"><span class="icon">🇮🇹</span> 100% olasz alapanyag</div>
  <div class="strip-item"><span class="icon">🌊</span> Balaton partján</div>
  <div class="strip-item"><span class="icon">☀️</span> Nyáron naponta nyitva</div>
  <div class="strip-item"><span class="icon">🍷</span> Helyi borok</div>
</div>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-text fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow">A mi történetünk</span>
      <h2>Receptünk <em>tradíció</em>, helyszínünk maga a paradicsom</h2>
      <p>
        Az Akalifornia Balatonakali strandjától néhány lépésre nyitotta meg kapuit, hogy a Balaton mellé az igazi olasz pizzaélményt hozza el. Faszenes kemencénkben sütjük pizzáinkat, ahogyan azt Nápolyban is teszik – semmi kompromisszum.
      </p>
      <p>
        Két hatalmas teraszunkon relaxálhatsz, nézheted a vitorlásokat és élvezheted a Balaton egyedülálló panorámáját. Mellé egy jéghideg limonádé, egy csapolt sör, vagy a Gergely Borház válogatott borai közül valamelyik – ez az igazi nyár.
      </p>
      <div class="about-badges">
        <span class="badge">🍕 Hely pizza</span>
        <span class="badge">☕ Olasz kávé</span>
        <span class="badge">🍷 Gergely Borház</span>
        <span class="badge">🎣 Strand közelben</span>
        <span class="badge">🌿 Friss alapanyagok</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-visual fade-up">
      <div class="logo-circle">🍕</div>
      <div class="logo-badge-tl">
        <div class="badge-dot"></div>
        Nyitva 09:00 – éjfélig
      </div>
      <div class="logo-badge-br">
        <div class="badge-dot" style="background:var(--coral)"></div>
        +36 20 360 6490
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MENU -->
<section class="menu-section" id="menu">
  <div class="section-center fade-up">
    <span class="eyebrow">A Kemencéből</span>
    <h2>Pizzáink – <em>mind kézzel készítve</em></h2>
    <p class="lead">Csak friss, minőségi olasz alapanyagok. Vékony tészta, tele ízzel – ahogyan Nápolyban szokás.</p>
  </div>
